  "obverse": {
    "description": "Dark purple print on light red-pink underprint, horizontal layout.\r\nMaría Rostworowski at right.\r\nIssuer name on top left; white country name on lower center, rotated 90º; face value in numbers on lower left corner, in numbers and letters on top right corner; black serial #s, seven digits with one letter prefix and one letter suffix, horizontal on lower left, vertical on right edge.\r\nThree signatures with titles below on top center; issuing date on lower left; watermark area on left; issuing date on lower left; windowed security strip on left; raised device for identification by visually impaired, three diagonal bars woth circle on top on left edge, without circle on right edge.",
    "lettering": "BANCO CENTRAL DEL PERÚ\r\nCINCUENTA SOLES\r\n50\r\nPRESIDENTE\r\nDIRECTOR\r\nGERENTE GENERAL\r\nPerú\r\nA12778148A\r\n21 DE MARZO DE 2019\r\nMARÍA ROSTWOROWSKI",
