  "comments": "<p>The note has a solid security strip windowed into three pieces on the obverse. Under backlight the whole strip can be seen. It has “50” repeated on it:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6845bdd5784ac.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6845bdd5784ac.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Brandon Bertolli</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Holographic feature on the security strip:</p><p>A dark bar rolls up and down the security thread and a diamond shape shrinks and expands as the note is tilted up and down.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/69783933203ce.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/69783933203ce.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/697839361933b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/697839361933b.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6978393e5669d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6978393e5669d.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/697839436c6b1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/697839436c6b1.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/69783958e39db.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/69783958e39db.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Kiet Tran</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The appearances of a 2019 note under infrared light:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6845be112d3c2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6845be112d3c2.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6845be5940602.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6845be5940602.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>UV activity on a 2019 note at 365nm:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6845be7ed4712.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6845be7ed4712.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6845be88ed7c8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6845be88ed7c8.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Brandon Bertolli</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Holographic feature 2:</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">The ornamental shape on the bottom-right of the obverse is printed in colour shifting ink which changes colour from gold and lime green when the note is tilted and features a moving floating ring inside of it.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6978371c492a8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6978371c492a8.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/697837201a256.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/697837201a256.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/697837242c92c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/697837242c92c.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6978372652a46.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6978372652a46.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6978379517368.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6978379517368.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/69783797d45e9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/69783797d45e9.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6978379b0847a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6978379b0847a.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6978379e0c4db.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6978379e0c4db.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">© Kiet Tran</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Hidden latent image in the patterned space to the right of María Rostworowski's face - denomination numeral 50 can be seen when looked at closely or the note is tilted:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/69783a4f120f8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/69783a4f120f8.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Kiet Tran</p>",
